{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qcyk7g3hat1793006451.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新皇崗口岸連續兩日在凌晨後出現擠塞，有專家認為由於車流量過多，加上深圳方接客位置設計問題，導致車龍倒灌。有立法會議員呼籲旅客避免同一時段過關。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202786-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%80%A3%E7%BA%8C%E5%85%A9%E6%97%A5%E5%87%8C%E6%99%A8%E5%BE%8C%E7%8F%BE%E6%93%A0%E5%A1%9E%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%8C%87%E6%B6%89%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%8E%A5%E5%AE%A2%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%A8%AD%E8%A8%88%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸連續兩日凌晨後現擠塞　專家指涉深圳方接客位置設計問題</strong></a></p><p></p><p>石鼓洲焚化爐下午發生三級火。消防在下午約1時半，將火警升為三級。至下午四時許，消防已包圍火勢，一人不適、約930人自行疏散，正調查起火原因。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202823-%E7%9F%B3%E9%BC%93%E6%B4%B2%E7%84%9A%E5%8C%96%E7%88%90%E4%B8%89%E7%B4%9A%E7%81%AB%E6%B6%88%E9%98%B2%E5%B7%B2%E5%8C%85%E5%9C%8D%E7%81%AB%E5%8B%A2%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E9%81%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>石鼓洲焚化爐三級火　消防已包圍火勢一人不適</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府最近五年安排約120名公務員到國際組織工作，公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵指，會要求攜帶無儲存資料的電腦，確保不會洩漏政府機密。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202785-%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%8B%99%E5%93%A1%E5%80%9F%E8%AA%BF%E5%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E6%B6%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%89%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E6%A5%8A%E4%BD%95%E8%93%93%E8%8C%B5%E7%A8%B1%E6%9C%89%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E7%A2%BA%E4%BF%9D%E4%B8%8D%E6%B4%A9%E6%BC%8F%E6%A9%9F%E5%AF%86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>議員關注公務員借調到國際組織涉國安風險　楊何蓓茵稱有措施確保不洩漏機密</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一名男子在元朗壆圍路貨倉被狗咬傷，送博愛醫院治理。漁護署之後將涉事唐狗帶走檢查。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202760-25%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E5%85%83%E6%9C%97%E5%A3%86%E5%9C%8D%E8%B7%AF%E8%B2%A8%E5%80%89%E5%85%A7%E8%A2%AB%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E5%82%B7%E9%80%81%E9%99%A2%E6%B2%BB%E7%90%86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>25歲男子元朗壆圍路貨倉內被狗咬傷　送院治理</strong></a></p><p></p><p>「一帶一路」綠色創新大會首次於本港舉行。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202765-%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%B6%E4%B8%80%E8%B7%AF%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>「一帶一路」綠色創新大會首次本港舉行</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:05.176352+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":420,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:58:09.687725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:12.733226+00:00","content_hash":"d5249efe2a7026e11508c2da5b4675785f0e244f4129aca67492c5f744cf03e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:05.176352+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}